        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>ㄱ, ㄷ, ㄹ, ㅂ</choice_text>
          <commentary>문제인식과 규칙준수는 원칙이 아니다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>ㄴ, ㄷ, ㅁ, ㅂ</choice_text>
          <commentary>규칙준수는 원칙이 아니다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
